$$
E = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i \cdot 4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 24 e^{-i\theta} + 36i e^{-i\theta}
$$

We want the **real part** of $ E $, so we extract the real part of each term:

